{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 0.1 Load packages",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Quiet[Remove[\"DCTDataImport`*\", \"NNLSFit`*\", \"DCTKernel`*\", \"DCT`*\",\r\n             \"DCTPlots`*\", \"DCTPeakAnalysis`*\", \"DCTSensitivity`*\",\r\n             \"DCTBiophysics`*\", \"DCTAdmittanceStats`*\", \"DCTKKCheck`*\"]];\r\n$ContextPath = Select[$ContextPath, !StringMatchQ[#, \"DCT*\" | \"NNLSFit*\"] &];\r\nGet[\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\DCT.wl\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76f4yz-9q6w810\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHRjb2xvcnsjMDBmZjAwfXtcdGV4dHvinJQgRENUIHBhY2thZ2UgbG9hZGVkLn19\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">✔ DCT package loaded.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "da2b5a14-f243-4d25-8328-633c1f8c4e60"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 0.2 Parameters",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ── PARAMETERS ── edit these, then re-run this cell ── *)\r\n\r\n(* Data directories *)\r\ndataDir          = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\drift_03252026\";  (* drift data — E1/E2/E3 subdirs *)\r\nconcentrationDir = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\spike\";           (* spike titration in PBS *)\r\n\r\n(* Fit parameters — tuned on drift data in Sections 1–3, locked here for all fits.\r\n   fMinHz is set automatically by Section 1.3 from the Lin-KK population analysis. *)\r\nlambdaND      = 1*^-3;  (* Tikhonov regularisation — from L-curve analysis *)\r\nfMaxHz        = 1000.;  (* upper frequency cutoff [Hz] *)\r\nweightPower   = -0.75;  (* admittance weight exponent *)\r\nbinsPerDecade = 15;     (* tau grid density *)\r\ntauMinFactor  = 0.1;    (* tau grid lower extension factor *)\r\ntauMaxFactor  = 10.;    (* tau grid upper extension factor *)\r\n\r\n(* Natural sort: group by electrode subdir, then by numeric file number.\r\n   Plain Sort gives lexicographic order (118 before 15) which breaks time ordering. *)\r\nsortFiles[files_List] := SortBy[files,\r\n  {FileNameTake[#, {-2}],\r\n   Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#], NumberString], 0]} &\r\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. KK Data Validation\nRuns Lin-KK on **all** drift files. A histogram of valid lower bounds across the population guides `fMinHz` selection via `kkFMinPercentile` (params). The representative file residuals plot gives a qualitative view of data quality.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1.1 File list",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Section 1 parameters *)\nkkResidualThreshold = 0.02;  (* point-by-point |residual|/|Y| threshold; try 0.05 if fMinHz is too high *)\nkkFMinPercentile    = 50;    (* percentile of fMin distribution across files; 50 = median *)\n\n(* Representative file index — residuals plot only; fMinHz comes from the full population *)\nrepFileIdx = 1;\n\n(* Load all drift files *)\ndriftFiles = sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]];\nPrint[\"Found \", Length[driftFiles], \" drift files in \", FileNameTake[dataDir]];\n\n(* Run Lin-KK on every file — basis for population-level fMinHz *)\nPrint[\"Running Lin-KK on all files...\"];\nkkAllResults = Map[DCTKKCheck`KKCheck[DCTDataImport`ImportEIS[#]] &, driftFiles];\nnPass = Count[kkAllResults, _?(#[\"OK\"] &)];\nPrint[nPass, \" / \", Length[kkAllResults], \" files pass Lin-KK overall.\"];\n\n(* Residuals plot for the representative file *)\nkkRep   = kkAllResults[[repFileIdx]];\nrepFile = driftFiles[[repFileIdx]];\nPrint[Style[\n  \"Rep file (\" <> FileNameTake[repFile] <> \"):  RMS Re = \" <>\n  ToString[NumberForm[100. kkRep[\"RMSRe\"], {4,2}]] <> \"%,  Im = \" <>\n  ToString[NumberForm[100. kkRep[\"RMSIm\"], {4,2}]] <> \"%  \" <>\n  If[kkRep[\"OK\"], \"\\[Checkmark] OK\", \"\\[Times] FAIL\"],\n  Bold, If[kkRep[\"OK\"], Darker[Green], Red], 13\n]];\nDCTPlots`PlotKKResiduals[kkRep]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Found </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76f50j-1omk55a\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> drift files in </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">drift_03252026</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Found[formula] drift files indrift_03252026",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "783141bd-034e-4c0a-9c20-ba4932214e60"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Running Lin-KK on all files...</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Running Lin-KK on all files...",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "64007cdd-dc58-44a2-ae11-47cf5a283512"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fgsa-ptwhngl\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"MTM5\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">139</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> / </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fgsb-vtg4dmn\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files pass Lin-KK overall.</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula] /[formula] files pass Lin-KK overall.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f1eaaa50-e98b-402f-9cf1-85b04f0d0b29"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fgsh-unr7hbw\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyMwMGZmMDB9e1x0ZXh0e1JlcCBmaWxlIChFMVxfRUlTXF8oMCkudHh0KTogIFJNUyBSZSA9IDEuMjZcJSwgIEltID0gMC44MlwlICDinJMgT0t9fX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">Rep file (E1_EIS_(0).txt): RMS Re = 1.26%, Im = 0.82% ✓ OK</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "9545c556-2067-4939-b14d-4f0aae2953a8"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"75\" data-out-n=\"334\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[334]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_8jh43wcswm7.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_8jh43wcswm7.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Representative file index — residuals plot only; fMinHz comes from the full population *)\nrepFileIdx = 1;\n\n(* Load all drift files *)\ndriftFiles = sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]];\nPrint[\"Found \", Length[driftFiles], \" drift files in \", FileNameTake[dataDir]];\n\n(* Run Lin-KK on every file — basis for population-level fMinHz *)\nPrint[\"Running Lin-KK on all files...\"];\nkkAllResults = Map[DCTKKCheck`KKCheck[DCTDataImport`ImportEIS[#]] &, driftFiles];\nnPass = Count[kkAllResults, _?(#[\"OK\"] &)];\nPrint[nPass, \" / \", Length[kkAllResults], \" files pass Lin-KK overall.\"];\n\n(* Residuals plot for the representative file *)\nkkRep   = kkAllResults[[repFileIdx]];\nrepFile = driftFiles[[repFileIdx]];\nPrint[Style[\n  \"Rep file (\" <> FileNameTake[repFile] <> \"):  RMS Re = \" <>\n  ToString[NumberForm[100. kkRep[\"RMSRe\"], {4,2}]] <> \"%,  Im = \" <>\n  ToString[NumberForm[100. kkRep[\"RMSIm\"], {4,2}]] <> \"%  \" <>\n  If[kkRep[\"OK\"], \"\\[Checkmark] OK\", \"\\[Times] FAIL\"],\n  Bold, If[kkRep[\"OK\"], Darker[Green], Red], 13\n]];\nDCTPlots`PlotKKResiduals[kkRep]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "87a8d748-45fd-4432-a7fb-46a03b862f16"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1.2 KK residuals",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* KK-valid lower bound for every file, using the threshold from params *)\nkkMins = Map[First[DCTKKCheck`KKValidFreqRange[#, kkResidualThreshold]] &, kkAllResults];\n\n(* Percentile table — inspect before accepting the automatic fMinHz *)\nPrint[Style[\"Lin-KK fMin distribution (threshold = \" <> ToString[100 kkResidualThreshold] <> \"%):\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Grid[\n  Prepend[\n    {ToString[#] <> \"th\", NumberForm[Quantile[kkMins, #/100.], {5,3}]} & /@ {0, 25, 50, 75, 90, 95, 100},\n    {Style[\"Percentile\", Bold], Style[\"fMin (Hz)\", Bold]}\n  ],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> {Right, Center}, Spacings -> {2, 0.8}\n]];\n\n(* Histogram — outlier files show up as a long right tail *)\nHistogram[kkMins, Automatic, \"Count\",\n  FrameLabel -> {\"Lin-KK fMin (Hz)\", \"Files\"},\n  PlotLabel -> \"Valid lower bound — all drift files\",\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, ImageSize -> 440]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fhdn-uzlhbfl\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dHtMaW4tS0sgZk1pbiBkaXN0cmlidXRpb246fX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lin-KK fMin distribution:</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "94fe619d-fcda-4d8a-9d42-ad25387c5629"
