    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"76\" data-out-n=\"338\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[338]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1f1zgt4hoxn3e.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1f1zgt4hoxn3e.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* KK-valid lower bound for every file *)\nkkMins = Map[First[DCTKKCheck`KKValidFreqRange[#]] &, kkAllResults];\n\n(* Percentile table — inspect before accepting the automatic fMinHz *)\nPrint[Style[\"Lin-KK fMin distribution:\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Grid[\n  Prepend[\n    {ToString[#] <> \"th\", NumberForm[Quantile[kkMins, #/100.], {5,3}]} & /@ {0, 25, 50, 75, 90, 95, 100},\n    {Style[\"Percentile\", Bold], Style[\"fMin (Hz)\", Bold]}\n  ],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> {Right, Center}, Spacings -> {2, 0.8}\n]];\n\n(* Histogram — outlier files show up as a long right tail *)\nHistogram[kkMins, Automatic, \"Count\",\n  FrameLabel -> {\"Lin-KK fMin (Hz)\", \"Files\"},\n  PlotLabel -> \"Valid lower bound — all drift files\",\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, ImageSize -> 440]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ce48bcb4-2323-48bb-ac07-c8e19712ea11"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1.3 Set fMinHz",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Set fMinHz from the population percentile defined in params.\n   If the histogram shows a long right tail (outlier files), lower kkFMinPercentile\n   or investigate those files individually. *)\nfMinHz = Quantile[kkMins, kkFMinPercentile / 100.];\nPrint[\"fMinHz \\[LeftArrow] \", NumberForm[fMinHz, {5,3}], \" Hz  \",\n      \"(\", kkFMinPercentile, \"th percentile of \", Length[kkMins], \" files)\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">fMinHz ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fhli-dwjwuo7\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mi41MTJ9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.512</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">(</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fhlj-dr4mf9z\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"NTA=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">th percentile of </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fhlk-pjswrbs\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: fMinHz ←[formula] Hz([formula]th percentile of[formula] files)",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "18c554b6-bc80-4157-96bc-aa7bb3a0c59c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Admittance Statistics\nCompute per-frequency mean and variance of |Y(f)| across all drift files (undecimated). CV plot flags unreliable frequencies; power-law scatter derives `weightPower`. Update the params cell with the suggested values before proceeding.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.1 Compute statistics",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Group files by electrode subdirectory, compute within-electrode variance stats,\n   then pool across electrodes for the power-law fit. Each electrode may have a\n   different absolute admittance level — pooling the (YMean, YVar) points across\n   all electrodes gives a better estimate of the noise scaling exponent alpha. *)\nelectrodeGroups = GroupBy[\n  sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]],\n  FileNameTake[#, {-2}] &   (* second-to-last path component = electrode name *)\n];\nPrint[\"Electrodes: \", Row[Keys[electrodeGroups], \", \"],\n  \"   files: \", Row[Length /@ Values[electrodeGroups], \" / \"]];\n\nelectrodeStats = Association @ KeyValueMap[\n  #1 -> DCTAdmittanceStats`ComputeAdmittanceStats[#2] &,\n  electrodeGroups\n];\n\ndriftStats = DCTAdmittanceStats`MergeAdmittanceStats[Values[electrodeStats]];\nIf[FailureQ[driftStats],\n  Print[Style[\"Failed: \" <> driftStats[\"Message\"], Red, Bold]],\n  Print[Style[\n    \"Done: \" <> ToString[driftStats[\"FilesOK\"]] <> \" / \" <>\n    ToString[driftStats[\"FilesTotal\"]] <> \" files across \" <>\n    ToString[Length[electrodeGroups]] <> \" electrodes, \" <>\n    ToString[Length[driftStats[\"FreqHz\"]]] <> \" pooled (freq, electrode) points.\",\n    Bold, Darker[Green]\n  ]]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Electrodes: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fhmp-7lqt5ri\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7RTF9XHRleHR7LCB9XHRleHR7RTJ9XHRleHR7LCB9XHRleHR7RTN9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E1</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E2</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E3</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   files: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fhmq-jt72vka\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"MTU0XHRleHR7IC8gfTE1Mlx0ZXh0eyAvIH0xNTI=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">154</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> / </span></span><span class=\"mord\">152</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> / </span></span><span class=\"mord\">152</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Electrodes:[formula]   files:[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "132a1388-ac20-4147-942a-c5b2e1b7f5b7"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fq8n-ovkp7kx\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyMwMGZmMDB9e1x0ZXh0e0RvbmU6IDQ1OCAvIDQ1OCBmaWxlcyBhY3Jvc3MgMyBlbGVjdHJvZGVzLCAxNTMgcG9vbGVkIChmcmVxLCBlbGVjdHJvZGUpIHBvaW50cy59fX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">Done: 458 / 458 files across 3 electrodes, 153 pooled (freq, electrode) points.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "67e182f9-4759-4fb2-8942-d4addaec5779"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.2 Variance vs mean",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Var vs |Y_mean| scatter — power-law fit gives weightPower *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"77\" data-out-n=\"346\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[346]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1ij648a2w532s.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1ij648a2w532s.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Var vs |Y_mean| scatter — power-law fit gives weightPower *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "fe9f7aff-b838-4701-a07d-70231074cd9c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.3 Set fMaxHz",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Above ~500 Hz the variance-vs-mean curve inflects away from the power law:\n   admittance is dominated by Rs / parasitic capacitance, not charge transfer.\n   DCT resolves nothing useful there — tighten the upper cutoff. *)\nfMaxHz = 500.;\nPrint[\"fMaxHz \\[LeftArrow] \", fMaxHz, \" Hz\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">fMaxHz ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fqpf-j5oxtcf\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"NTAwLlws\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: fMaxHz ←[formula] Hz",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "26b534d9-15c8-46e8-b137-4a19bdc2f554"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.4 Variance overview",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* All data shown; power-law fit and annotation use only [fMinHz, fMaxHz].\n   Dashed vertical lines mark the fit boundaries. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"78\" data-out-n=\"349\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[349]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_3v6wbsni7t07.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_3v6wbsni7t07.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* All data shown; power-law fit and annotation use only [fMinHz, fMaxHz].\n   Dashed vertical lines mark the fit boundaries. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a3e1f362-00a6-4044-8470-c67fe39b685d"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.5 Parameter readout",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fMinHz\r\nfMaxHz",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"79\" data-out-n=\"350\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[350]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76frb8-1v7heb7\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"Mi41MTE5\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5119</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
