     ],
     "id": "0c642c58-eda3-48a5-8638-f5a010ab7a78"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.3 Verify λ",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Verify chosen λ: g(k) overlay (left) and Bode residuals (right) *)\nModule[{n, cols, styles, fTicks, magTraces, phaseTraces,\n        gkPlot, magPlot, phasePlot, darkBg, fgSt, lblSt},\n\n  darkBg = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgSt   = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]];\n  lblSt  = Directive[White, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"];\n\n  n      = Length[lSweepSpecs];\n  cols   = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.90/Max[n-1,1]}];\n  styles = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ cols;\n  fTicks = Table[{10.^p, Superscript[10, p]},\n             {p, Floor[Log10[fMinHz]], Ceiling[Log10[fMaxHz]]}];\n\n  magTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        100. Abs[sp[\"YIntFit\"] - sp[\"YIntData\"]] / Abs[sp[\"YIntData\"]]}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  phaseTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        (Arg[sp[\"YIntFit\"]] - Arg[sp[\"YIntData\"]]) * 180/Pi}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  gkPlot = DCTPlots`PlotGK[lSweepSpecs, Automatic, ImageSize -> 460];\n\n  magPlot = ListLinePlot[magTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"|\" <> \"\\[CapitalDelta]\" <> \"Y| / |Y| (%)\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    PlotRange -> {Automatic, {0, Automatic}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  phasePlot = ListLinePlot[phaseTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"\\[CapitalDelta]Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  Row[{gkPlot, Spacer[12], Column[{magPlot, phasePlot}, Spacings -> 0.3]},\n    Alignment -> Center]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"319475\" data-output-id=\"82\" data-out-n=\"364\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"36\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"53\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[364]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_10h1atj79ua1.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_10h1atj79ua1.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Verify chosen λ: g(k) overlay (left) and Bode residuals (right) *)\nModule[{n, cols, styles, fTicks, magTraces, phaseTraces,\n        gkPlot, magPlot, phasePlot, darkBg, fgSt, lblSt},\n\n  darkBg = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgSt   = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]];\n  lblSt  = Directive[White, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"];\n\n  n      = Length[lSweepSpecs];\n  cols   = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.90/Max[n-1,1]}];\n  styles = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ cols;\n  fTicks = Table[{10.^p, Superscript[10, p]},\n             {p, Floor[Log10[fMinHz]], Ceiling[Log10[fMaxHz]]}];\n\n  magTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        100. Abs[sp[\"YIntFit\"] - sp[\"YIntData\"]] / Abs[sp[\"YIntData\"]]}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  phaseTraces = Table[\n    Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]},\n      Transpose[{sp[\"FreqHz\"],\n        (Arg[sp[\"YIntFit\"]] - Arg[sp[\"YIntData\"]]) * 180/Pi}]\n    ], {i, n}];\n\n  gkPlot = DCTPlots`PlotGK[lSweepSpecs, Automatic, ImageSize -> 460];\n\n  magPlot = ListLinePlot[magTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"|\" <> \"\\[CapitalDelta]\" <> \"Y| / |Y| (%)\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    PlotRange -> {Automatic, {0, Automatic}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  phasePlot = ListLinePlot[phaseTraces, PlotStyle -> styles,\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False,\n    Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgSt, LabelStyle -> lblSt,\n    FrameTicks -> {{Automatic, None}, {fTicks, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {\n      {Style[\"\\[CapitalDelta]Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, White], None},\n      {Style[\"f (Hz)\", 13, White], None}},\n    ImageSize -> 360, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n\n  Row[{gkPlot, Spacer[12], Column[{magPlot, phasePlot}, Spacings -> 0.3]},\n    Alignment -> Center]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "be53fde7-7b4d-451e-a29f-329b6f92db06"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Drift Fit\nRun once (or after changing parameters). `driftFiles` and `goodSpecs` are used by the plot cells below.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4.1 Batch drift fit",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fileDecimation = 1;  (* 1 = all files, N = every Nth — reduce for faster tuning *)\n\ndriftFiles = sortFiles[\n  Take[\n    sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]],\n    ;; ;; fileDecimation\n  ]\n];\nPrint[\"Found \", Length[driftFiles], \" files (decimated) from \", FileNameTake[dataDir]];\n\nresults = Table[\n  Module[{spec},\n    If[Mod[i, Max[1, Round[Length[driftFiles]/10]]] == 1,\n      Print[i, \" / \", Length[driftFiles], \"  \", FileNameTake[driftFiles[[i]]]]\n    ];\n    spec = Quiet @ Check[\n      DCT`DCTSpectrum[driftFiles[[i]],\n        \"LambdaND\"      -> lambdaND,\n        \"FMinUse\"       -> fMinHz,\n        \"FMaxUse\"       -> fMaxHz,\n        \"WeightPower\"   -> weightPower,\n        \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n        \"TauMinFactor\"  -> tauMinFactor,\n        \"TauMaxFactor\"  -> tauMaxFactor\n      ], $Failed\n    ];\n    <|\"File\" -> driftFiles[[i]], \"Spec\" -> spec, \"OK\" -> AssociationQ[spec]|>\n  ],\n  {i, Length[driftFiles]}\n];\n\ngoodSpecs = Select[results, #OK === True &];\nPrint[Style[ToString[Length[goodSpecs]] <> \" / \" <> ToString[Length[driftFiles]] <> \" fits succeeded.\", Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Found </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76fszf-rfcjgyj\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files (decimated) from </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">drift_03252026</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Found[formula] files (decimated) fromdrift_03252026",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d7e83ed0-7003-45e0-a6d1-a4381258acb4"
    },
    {
     "items": [
