  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Concentration Analysis\nSet `concentrationDir` in the params cell first. Uses the same locked parameters as the drift fit.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.1 Batch concentration fit",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Batch fit concentration files with locked parameters *)\nIf[concentrationDir === \"\",\n  Print[Style[\"concentrationDir is empty \\[LongDash] set it in the params cell.\", Red, Bold]],\n\n  (* helpers: extract electrode tag and numeric concentration from filename *)\n  concElec[f_]  := First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], \"E\" ~~ d:DigitCharacter :> d], \"0\"];\n  concUM[f_]    := ToExpression @ First[\n    StringCases[FileNameTake[f], n:NumberString ~~ \"uM\" :> n], \"0\"];\n  concLabel[f_] := Module[{elec, conc},\n    elec = First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], \"E\" ~~ d:DigitCharacter :> \"E\" <> d], \"?\"];\n    conc = First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], n:NumberString ~~ \"uM\" :> n], \"?\"];\n    elec <> \" \" <> conc <> \" \\[Mu]M\"\n  ];\n\n  (* sort: electrode first, then by numeric concentration *)\n  concFiles = SortBy[\n    FileNames[\"*.txt\", concentrationDir],\n    {concElec[#], concUM[#]} &\n  ];\n  Print[\"Found \", Length[concFiles], \" concentration files.\"];\n\n  (* frequency range summary — print before fits start *)\n  Print[\"Nominal fit range:  \", fMinHz, \" \\[Dash] \", fMaxHz, \" Hz\"];\n  Module[{dat, freqInRange},\n    dat = DCTDataImport`ImportEIS[concFiles[[1]]];\n    If[AssociationQ[dat],\n      freqInRange = Select[dat[\"FreqHz\"], fMinHz <= # <= fMaxHz &];\n      Print[\"Actual freq range:   \",\n        NumberForm[Min[freqInRange], {6,3}], \" \\[Dash] \",\n        NumberForm[Max[freqInRange], {6,3}], \" Hz  (\",\n        Length[freqInRange], \" points)\"]\n    ]\n  ];\n\n  concResults = Table[\n    Module[{spec},\n      If[Mod[i, Max[1, Round[Length[concFiles]/6]]] == 1,\n        Print[i, \" / \", Length[concFiles], \"  \", concLabel[concFiles[[i]]]]\n      ];\n      spec = Quiet @ Check[\n        DCT`DCTSpectrum[concFiles[[i]],\n          \"LambdaND\"      -> lambdaND,\n          \"FMinUse\"       -> fMinHz,\n          \"FMaxUse\"       -> fMaxHz,\n          \"WeightPower\"   -> weightPower,\n          \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n          \"TauMinFactor\"  -> tauMinFactor,\n          \"TauMaxFactor\"  -> tauMaxFactor\n        ], $Failed\n      ];\n      <|\"File\" -> concLabel[concFiles[[i]]], \"Spec\" -> spec, \"OK\" -> AssociationQ[spec]|>\n    ],\n    {i, Length[concFiles]}\n  ];\n\n  concGoodSpecs = Select[concResults, #OK === True &];\n  Print[Style[\n    ToString[Length[concGoodSpecs]] <> \" / \" <> ToString[Length[concFiles]] <>\n    \" concentration fits succeeded.\",\n    Bold, Darker[Green]\n  ]]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Found </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mjzn-g9n7zhg\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"MjQ=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> concentration files.</span></div></div><div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Nominal fit range:  </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mk04-bonz2p2\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"Mi41MTE5\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5119</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> – </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mk05-j20g587\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"NTAwLlws\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz</span></div></div><div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Actual freq range:   </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mk15-l0znul9\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mi41MTJ9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.512</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> – </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mk17-s532su4\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mzk4LjExMH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">398.110</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz  (</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mk18-cqvv1oa\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"MjM=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> points)</span></div><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq76mk19-d8wawqw\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"MQ==\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\